# EXP_0021: silhouette masks derived from all-rights-reserved control/unpaired photos.
# Derived numbers go in the repo; a traced outline of a copyrighted photograph does not.
reports/repeatability/masks/

# Derived imagery from the found-pair photographs (all-rights-reserved tutorial and retailer images): renders,
# masks, panels and diffs are derivative works of photographs this project is not licensed to redistribute, and the
# policy in data/external/README.md is that only derived NUMBERS enter the repository. .gitignore covered
# experiments/pairs/ but not the other batch directories, so every A/B arm committed its renders (EXP_0022).
experiments/**/*.png
experiments/**/*.jpg
experiments/**/*.jpeg
